# Deny-by-default: this directory holds Rubanova's ~600 MB of loose 2020
# ВКР working files (deeppavlov morphology dumps, dict.opcorpora.txt 283 MB,
# archive/rus_words.txt 128 MB, raw corpus text dumps, the .pptx). Only the
# reusable small artifacts below (santricism indexes, name lists, stemmer
# rules, manual adjudications) are tracked — they feed Wave 2/3 of
# docs/ROADMAP_NKRYA_PARALLEL_RUSCORPORA_2026_2027.md. Everything else stays
# local-only; see MANIFEST_LOCAL_ONLY.md for the full inventory.
#
# This pattern is intentionally deny-by-default (not an enumerated bulk
# list) so a future `git add` here can never re-swallow the bulk — only
# files explicitly un-ignored below can ever be tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!MANIFEST_LOCAL_ONLY.md

# санскритизм / index lists
!3_INDEX.txt
!3_INDEX_oneword.txt
!3_INDEX_options.txt
!3_INDEX_phrases.txt
!INDEX3_extra.txt
!INDEX3_intersection.txt
!INDEX3_lack.txt
!automated_index_01.txt
!automated_index_01_part.txt
!automated_index_02.txt
!automated_index_forms_01.txt
!automated_index_forms_01_part.txt
!automated_index_forms_02.txt
!automated_index_Рам_01_02.txt
!automated_index_Рам_03.txt
!automated_index_Рамаяна_3.txt
!automated_index_forms_Рам_01_02.txt
!automated_index_forms_Рам_03.txt
!automated_index_forms_Рамаяна_3.txt
!Ram3_automated_index_forms.txt

# name lists
!Ramayana_names.txt
!Ramayana_names_clean.txt
!Ramayana_names_clean_united.txt

# Rubanova's source code (Evgeniya Rubanova, updated by Marsel) — the
# pipeline's source of truth, documented in
# docs/RUBANOVA_NKRYA_PIPELINE_MANUAL.md (H904). Small (~50 KB each);
# these are code, not the bulk data the deny-by-default rule guards.
!sans_stemmer.ipynb
!deeppavlov_parsing.ipynb
!corpus_marker.ipynb

# stemmer / declension rules + lexicons
!decl_rules.txt
!rusforms.txt
!9460-osnov-sanskritskikh-slov.txt
!foreign_words.txt
!rus_index.txt
!rus_index_declined.txt
!correct_trans.txt
!translation.txt
!pluralis_племена.txt
!append if found.txt

# archive/ — manual adjudications + epithet/synonym lists only (≤120 KB each)
!archive/
!archive/03_1_manually.txt
!archive/03_2_manually.txt
!archive/03_3_manually.txt
!archive/03_4_manually.txt
!archive/03_5_manually.txt
!archive/03_manual.txt
!archive/3_morph_manual.txt
!archive/manual_words.txt
!archive/epith_3.txt
!archive/new_epith_3.txt
